ght spillover and soft diffuse reflection are applied to maintain the clarity and brightness characteristic of e-commerce visuals.\n\nSimultaneously, fine and sharp highlights, micro-reflective details, and light shaping are added to the product surface,\n\ngiving the material the texture and depth of luxury advertising.\n\nThe product's geometry and proportions remain completely unchanged.\n\nNatural, ground-hugging contact shadows are generated for the product, while slightly hardened directional projections are added.\n\nThe edges of the shadows are moderately softened, achieving a balance between the natural feel of e-commerce soft lighting and the textured contrast of luxury hard lighting.\n\nGenerate sophisticated yet understated reflections on smooth surfaces, water, glass, or metal environments:\nSmooth surfaces produce clear yet controlled reflections; semi-gloss surfaces offer softened reflections; all reflection directions are strictly matched to the main light source.\n\nAdd subtle and natural secondary reflections to the product, making highlights more three-dimensional and shadows cleaner;\n\nAchieve a blend of high-end texture, sharp contours, and a soft, luminous atmosphere.\n\nFinally, achieve a seamless blending effect with high resolution, refined lighting, clean backgrounds, and a combination of realistic soft light and sophisticated hard light, meeting e-commerce standards while possessing a luxury-movie-level quality.\n\nStrictly maintain the product's original color, hue, tone, and color proportions; alteration of the product's inherent color is not permitted.\n\nWhen rematching lighting, only adjust the light and shadow relationships, without changing the color category or value itself."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 4, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 94, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": 